{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["And the sense of <b>and they ceased building the city</b>: to complete it, for they had already built part of the city and part of the tower, for thus it is written <b>which the children of men built</b>. Or the meaning of <b>which the children of men built</b> may be in their thought, and similarly <b>and he fought against Israel</b> (Joshua 24:9) concerning Balak. And the first is correct in my eyes."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:09.199008266Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}